We've just released #HedgeDoc 1.12.0 🎉

This release drops support for Node 18, so please upgrade your node version before upgrading in case of manual deployments.

Also included in this release are:
- bugfixes for the realtime code for flaky network connections
- allows skipping the login modal when exactly one external auth provider is configured
- links always open in new tabs again

Read the full changelog on https://hedgedoc.org/releases/1.12.0/
